\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\tab OUR Father, hear our longing prayer,
\par \pard\li720 And help this prayer to flow,
\par That humble thoughts, which are Thy care,
\par May live in us and grow.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.\tab For lowly hearts shall understand
\par \pard\li720 The peace, the calm delight
\par Of  dwelling in Thy heavenly land,
\par A pleasure in Thy sight.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.\tab Give us humility, that so 
\par \pard\li720 Thy reign may come within,
\par And when Thy children homeward go,
\par We too may enter in.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.\tab Hear us, our Saviour ! Ours Thou art,
\par \pard\li720 Though we are not like Thee ;
\par Give us Thy spirit in a heart
\par Large, lowly, trusting free.
\par Amen. 
\par \pard 
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

